bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Rating Like Button (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control RatingController
control RatingLikeService
entity RatingLikeModel
entity RatingModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click Like / Unlike rating
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /rating/toggle
activate Router

Router -> RatingController: 3. toggle(ratingId)
activate RatingController

loop User role not authorized / Rating missing / Invalid ratingId type
    RatingController --> Router: 3.1.1. 401 Unauthorized
    Router --> UI: 3.1.2. Show error
    UI --> User: 3.1.3. Show error
end

RatingController -> RatingLikeService: 4. toggleLike(ratingId, userId)

activate RatingLikeService
RatingLikeService -> RatingLikeModel: 5. Find existing like
activate RatingLikeModel
RatingLikeModel -> MongoDB: 6. findOne({ ratingId, userId })
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> RatingLikeModel: 7. Like document / null
deactivate MongoDB
RatingLikeModel --> RatingLikeService: 8. Existing like
deactivate RatingLikeModel

opt Already liked (UNLIKE)
    ref over RatingLikeService, MongoDB: 8.1. Subsequence - React rating 1
    opt Have error
        RatingLikeService --> RatingController: 8.1.1. Return unliked & likesCount
        RatingController --> Router: 8.1.2. HTTP response
        Router --> UI: 8.1.3. Update like UI
        UI --> User: 8.1.4. Show like state
    end
end


ref over RatingLikeService, MongoDB: 9. Subsequence - React rating 2

RatingLikeService --> RatingController: 10. Return liked & likesCount
deactivate RatingLikeService

RatingController --> Router: 11. HTTP response
deactivate RatingController
Router --> UI: 12. Update like UI
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 13. Show like state
deactivate UI
deactivate User